💭 A collection literal expected as an optional collection has the type of the collection, even if it is empty.
🏁 🍇
  🖍🆕 o 🍬🍨🐚🔢🍆
  🍿🍆 ➡️ 🖍 o
  😀 🔡📏🍺o❓ 10❗️❗️

  🖍🆕 d 🍬🍯🐚🔢🍆
  🍿➡️🍆 ➡️ 🖍 d
  😀 🔡📏🍺d❓ 10❗️❗️

  💭 The expected optional collection is boxed.
  📣 🍿 🍿🍆 🤷‍♀️ 🍿 4 5 🍆 🍆 🍨🐚🍬🍨🐚🔢🍆🍆 ➡️ lists
